  "sentences": [
    {
      "segments": [
        {
          "text": "Leo goes outside to play with his "
        },
        {
          "text": "pet",
          "wordIds": [
            "pet"
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " "
        },
        {
          "text": "dog",
          "wordIds": [
            "dog"
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " in the "
        },
        {
          "text": "yard",
          "wordIds": [
            "yard"
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "."
        }
      ],
      "translation": "Leo 走到戶外，在院子裡和他養的寵物狗一起玩。"
    },
    {
      "segments": [
        {
          "text": "Mom pours fresh "
        },
        {
          "text": "water",
          "wordIds": [
            "water"
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " into a clean "
        },
        {
          "text": "bowl",
          "wordIds": [
            "bowl"
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " and says, “"
        },
        {
          "text": "Let's give the ",
          "phraseIds": [
            "lets-give-the-dog-some-water"
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "dog",
          "phraseIds": [
            "lets-give-the-dog-some-water"
          ],
          "wordIds": [
            "dog"
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " some ",
          "phraseIds": [
            "lets-give-the-dog-some-water"
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "water",
          "phraseIds": [
            "lets-give-the-dog-some-water"
          ],
          "wordIds": [
            "water"
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": ".",
          "phraseIds": [
            "lets-give-the-dog-some-water"
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "”"
        }
      ],
      "translation": "媽媽把乾淨的水倒進碗裡，說：「我們給狗狗倒點水吧。」"
    },
    {
      "segments": [
        {
          "text": "Next, Leo fills the food "
        },
        {
          "text": "bowl",
          "wordIds": [
            "bowl"
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " and calls, “"
        },
        {
          "text": "Time to eat!",
          "phraseIds": [
            "time-to-eat"
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "”"
        }
      ],
      "translation": "接著，Leo 裝滿飼料碗並大聲喊：「吃飯時間到了！」"
    },
    {
      "segments": [
        {
          "text": "After eating, Leo gently brushes Toby's fur and smiles, “"
        },
        {
          "text": "Good boy!",
          "phraseIds": [
            "good-boy"
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "”"
        }
      ],
      "translation": "吃完後，Leo 溫柔地幫 Toby 梳毛並笑著說：「好乖！」"
    },
    {
      "segments": [
        {
          "text": "Then, Leo throws a red "
        },
        {
          "text": "ball",
          "wordIds": [
            "ball"
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " across the grass and shouts, “"
        },
        {
          "text": "Fetch the ",
          "phraseIds": [
            "fetch-the-ball"
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "ball",
          "phraseIds": [
            "fetch-the-ball"
          ],
          "wordIds": [
            "ball"
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": ".",
          "phraseIds": [
            "fetch-the-ball"
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "”"
        }
      ],
      "translation": "然後，Leo 把一顆紅色的球丟過草地，大聲喊：「去把球撿回來。」"
    },
    {
      "segments": [
        {
          "text": "Toby happily brings the "
        },
        {
          "text": "ball",
          "wordIds": [
            "ball"
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " back to Leo's hands."
        }
      ],
      "translation": "Toby 開心地把球叼回 Leo 的手上。"
    }
